,{"ana":151},{"layout":717},{"p":718,"rs":719,"damage":720},"The beginning of two lines of monumental letters are preserved on the stone. A substantial left margin is preserved at the start of each line. Unless the lines below were substantially further indented, there was no text below; the preserved vacat above line 1 (90mm)  is significantly greater than that between lines 1 and 2 (57mm), so it is unclear if another line originally stood above (the top of the stone appears intact) - if it did, it was either significantly above the preserved first line and/or indented several letters to the right.",{"_":53,"ana":54,"ref":55},{"ana":157},{"lettering":722,"dimensions":723},"Deep, very regular, v-cut letters, with a broad v-cut, hair-line extensions to wedge serifs, and a quite wide square module. The I in line one is extended.",[724,727,730],{"type":59,"l":60,"from":61,"to":61,"h":725,"unit":63,"atLeast":726,"atMost":726},"68 (I = 87)","68",{"type":59,"l":728,"from":67,"to":67,"h":729,"unit":63,"atLeast":729,"atMost":729},"Line 2","58",{"type":65,"l":66,"from":61,"to":67,"h":731,"unit":63,"atLeast":731,"atMost":731},"57",{"_":165,"notBefore":166,"notAfter":167,"evidence":73},[734,735],{"_":76,"type":77,"ref":78,"corresp":170,"region":79},{"_":8,"type":81,"ref":82,"region":79},[737],[85,86],[],{"_":4,"role":3,"ref":5},{"_":94,"mainLang":95,"languages":741},[94],{"n":98,"url":743,"height":181,"width":180,"desc":182,"surfaceType":103},"ISic003420_tiled.tif",[745,747,749],{"atLeast":746,"atMost":746},68,{"atLeast":748,"atMost":748},58,{"atLeast":750,"atMost":750},57,[752,675],"Korhonen, 2004, La cultura epigrafica della colonia di Catina nell'alto impero",[754,683],"NMS48IZF",[756,757,758,616,139,759,118,119,120,121,119,122,123,95],"isic003420","fragment of an imperial honorific",{"_":19},"coarse-grained, homogeneous, white marble, likely proconnesian (identification based on digital microscopy)","\u003Cdiv class=\"textpart\" lang=\"la\">\u003Cspan class=\"ab\" id=\"div